The fixtures in this directory were written for Yuva and contain no copied material.

- reply/: e-mails that imitate the reply formats of common mail clients (Gmail on the web and
  Android, Outlook desktop, web and mobile, Apple Mail on macOS and iOS, Thunderbird) in English
  and Turkish, with example.com addresses and invented content. Each `.txt` holds the text that
  should remain visible after quote and signature stripping.
- ses_bounce.json: an Amazon SES bounce notification shaped after the notification format AWS
  documents, with placeholder addresses and ids filled in by the tests.
- arf_abuse.eml: an abuse report in the Abuse Reporting Format (RFC 5965), written after the format
  the RFC describes, with example addresses and invented ids.
- forwarding/gmail_confirmation.eml: a Gmail forwarding confirmation written after the format Gmail
  sends to a forwarding address (subject with the code, the code and the vf- link in the text),
  with example addresses, an invented code and an invented link token.
